WEBVTT

00:00:00.473 --> 00:00:02.700
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1, F

00:00:03.815 --> 00:00:06.731
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> We rented a house near the university.

00:00:08.686 --> 00:00:10.720
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2, C

00:00:11.895 --> 00:00:15.270
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> We booked our flights. It was a long journey!

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:19.382
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3, D

00:00:20.547 --> 00:00:24.550
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> We invited our friends to our local pub to say goodbye.

00:00:26.617 --> 00:00:28.691
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4, E

00:00:30.025 --> 00:00:32.718
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> We packed seven heavy suitcases.

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:37.091
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5, A

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:41.016
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> The children didn't want to sleep on the plane.

00:00:41.593 --> 00:00:45.861
Sacha played with Lego and Elena looked at books.

00:00:47.774 --> 00:00:50.397
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6, B

00:00:51.626 --> 00:00:55.683
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> When we arrived in North Carolina, we were very tired!